        "slc_61d6a194640dd4634a657ce4c233f73bb67f9d917f4c57c6b43fe5ee09dfcdc2"
      ],
      "text": "Vendo is an embedded agent for B2B SaaS that acts through the host product's own API as the signed-in user and renders generated UI in a sandboxed, brand-native surface without touching host source code."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_8471d28b3fc8babfa88846d5467c8eb94d234ff4466defc381217d5f026619a3",
